{
  "title": "Yellow Spicy Algerian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A briny and fluffy Algerian dish featuring grape juice and bhuna, this tagine is perfect for midnight cravings and is ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
